{"article": " <h2 id=\"핵심-개념\">핵심 개념</h2>\n<p><strong>안전계수(SF)</strong>는 재료의 파괴·한계 하중과 실제 허용 또는 사용 하중 사이의 여유를 나타내는 비율임</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>한계(파괴)하중</mtext><mtext>허용(사용)하중</mtext></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mtext>허용응력</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>인장강도</mtext><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\begin{aligned}\nSF &#x26;= \\frac{\\text{한계(파괴)하중}}{\\text{허용(사용)하중}} \\\\\n\\text{허용응력} &#x26;= \\frac{\\text{인장강도}}{SF}\n\\end{aligned}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.7093em;vertical-align:-2.1047em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6047em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.6047em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.0083em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">허용응력</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.1047em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.6047em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.6047em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">허용</span><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">사용</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">하중</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">한계</span><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">파괴</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">하중</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.0083em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.427em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">인장강도</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.1047em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>문항에 따라 분자와 분모가 바뀌어 보일 수 있으므로 용어를 먼저 확인함</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>한계값에 해당하는 표현</th><th>사용값에 해당하는 표현</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>파단하중, 극한하중, 인장강도</td><td>허용하중, 정격하중, 허용응력</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>하중끼리 또는 응력끼리 비교해야 함</p>\n<p>한계하중을 허용응력으로 나누는 것처럼 물리량이 다른 값을 바로 나누지 않음</p>\n<h2 id=\"계산-기준\">계산 기준</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>파괴하중·인장강도·허용하중 중 어떤 값이 주어졌는지 표시함</li>\n<li>안전계수의 정의에 맞춰 분자와 분모를 배치함</li>\n<li>단위가 같은지 확인하고 결과는 무차원 비율로 정리함</li>\n</ol>\n<p>와이어로프, 달기기구, 구조부재의 계산 문제에서 같은 원리를 적용하되, 각 문항의 출제 기준을 넘어서 고정 수치를 주장하지 않음</p>\n<h2 id=\"대표-계산\">대표 계산</h2>\n<h3 id=\"허용응력-구하기\">허용응력 구하기</h3>\n<p>2022년 4월 시험 49번은 인장강도 <code>250 N/mm²</code>, 안전계수 4를 제시함</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>허용응력</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>250</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>62.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{허용응력}=\\frac{250}{4}=62.5\\ \\mathrm{N/mm^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">허용응력</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">250</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">62.5</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N/m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>2018년 3월 시험 55번도 같은 구조임</p>\n<p>인장강도 <code>350 MPa</code>를 안전계수 4로 나누면 <code>87.5 MPa</code>임</p>\n<p><code>1 MPa = 1 N/mm²</code>이므로 단위를 바꿔 쓸 수 있음</p>\n<h3 id=\"안전계수-구하기\">안전계수 구하기</h3>\n<p>2021년 8월 시험 49번은 인장강도 <code>420 MPa</code>, 허용응력 <code>140 MPa</code>를 제시함</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>420</mn><mn>140</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SF=\\frac{420}{140}=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">140</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">420</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>2020년 6월 시험 55번에서 최대하중이 700 N이고 정격하중이 100 N이면 안전계수는 <code>700/100=7</code>임</p>\n<p>응력 문제와 하중 문제 모두 <strong>한계값 ÷ 사용값</strong>이라는 구조는 같음</p>\n<h3 id=\"정격하중-구하기\">정격하중 구하기</h3>\n<p>2020년 9월 시험 42번은 극한하중 600 N, 안전계수 4를 제시함</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>정격하중</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>600</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{정격하중}=\\frac{600}{4}=150\\ \\mathrm{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord hangul_fallback\">정격하중</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">N</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>구하려는 값이 분모에 있으면 곱셈으로 착각하기 쉬우므로 먼저 기본식을 쓴 뒤 대수적으로 정리함</p>\n<h2 id=\"시험-포인트\">시험 포인트</h2>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>문제에서 보이는 키워드</th><th>정답으로 연결</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SF</td><td><strong><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>한계(파괴)하중</mtext><mtext>허용(사용)하중</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SF = \\frac{\\text{한계(파괴)하중}}{\\text{허용(사용)하중}}